WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.918
In headline terms,

00:00:03.998 --> 00:00:07.916
MuSc reaches ninety-seven point eight percent image
AUROC on MVTec AD and ninety-two point eight on VisA,

00:00:07.996 --> 00:00:11.914
with pixel AUROC of ninety-seven point three and
ninety-eight point eight.

00:00:11.994 --> 00:00:15.912
It adds over twenty-one points on MVTec
segmentation, all with no training, prompts,

00:00:15.992 --> 00:00:19.910
or references.
